title: Expelled
subtitle: The leadership expels your faction's leaders.
new-page: true
tags: rf_event
view-if: rf_over = 0 and player_leads = 0 and player_dissent >= 80
max-visits: 1

= Expelled

The Zentrale, under the [+ leader_name +], announces the expulsion of your faction's leaders for factional activity and breach of discipline. Moscow does not object.

You have three roads.

- @capitulate: Recant, sign a declaration of loyalty, and ask to be readmitted.
- @splinter: Found a new party with the comrades who follow you.
- @leave: Leave the Communist movement.

@capitulate
on-arrival: {!
Q[Q.player + '_dissent'] = 30;
Q[Q.player + '_strength'] = 5;
Q[Q.player + '_moscow'] = 10;
window.RF.normalize(Q);
!}

Your declaration is printed in the Rote Fahne. You are readmitted, without posts and without a voice. Some of your old comrades will never forgive you; others do the same a month later.

@splinter
on-arrival: rf_over = 1; rf_ending = "splinter"

You found a new party.

@leave
on-arrival: rf_over = 1; rf_ending = "leave"

You leave.
